<view class="page profile-page">
  <block wx:if="{{user}}"><view class="profile-hero"><view class="avatar">{{avatarText}}</view><view><strong>{{user.displayName}}</strong><text>{{user.employeeNo}} · {{rolesText}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{user.passwordChangeRequired}}" class="card password-card"><view class="warning-title">首次登录，请先修改密码</view><view class="warning-text">默认密码仅用于首次登录。新密码至少8位，且同时包含字母和数字。</view><input password value="{{currentPassword}}" placeholder="当前密码（默认是本人工号）" bindinput="inputCurrent"/><input password value="{{newPassword}}" placeholder="新密码" bindinput="inputNew"/><input password value="{{confirmPassword}}" placeholder="再次输入新密码" bindinput="inputConfirm"/><button class="primary" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="changePassword">修改密码并继续</button></view>
    <block wx:else><view class="card menu"><view bindtap="goMessages"><text>消息中心</text><text>›</text></view><view bindtap="goHistory"><text>我的绩效记录</text><text>›</text></view><view wx:if="{{!user.wechatBound}}" bindtap="bindWechat"><view><text>绑定当前微信</text><small>选填，绑定后可一键登录和接收订阅消息</small></view><text>›</text></view><view wx:else><view><text>微信账号</text><small class="bound">已绑定，可使用微信一键登录</small></view><text>✓</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{user.administrator}}" class="admin-tip">系统管理员配置入口仅在 Web 管理后台显示。</view></block>
    <button class="wechat" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="switchAccount">切换账号</button><button class="logout" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="switchAccount">退出登录</button>
  </block>
  <block wx:else><view class="login-brand"><view class="brand-mark">测</view><strong>测试工程部积分绩效</strong><text>责任排班 · 绩效闭环 · 设备异常归档</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card login-card"><view class="field"><text>账号 / 工号</text><input value="{{username}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="请输入账号或工号" bindinput="inputUsername"/></view><view class="field"><text>密码</text><input value="{{password}}" password maxlength="128" placeholder="请输入密码" bindinput="inputPassword"/></view><button class="primary" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="accountLogin">账号密码登录</button><view class="login-tip">账号密码登录不会绑定或替换当前微信，测试其他账号请使用此方式。</view><view class="divider">微信登录（可选）</view><block wx:if="{{!wechatVerified}}"><view class="warning-text">选择账号密码登录，或使用已绑定的微信登录。</view><button class="wechat" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="wechatLogin">微信一键登录</button></block><block wx:else><view class="warning-title">微信验证成功</view><view class="warning-text">首次使用请绑定本人工号。</view><view class="field"><text>工号</text><input value="{{username}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="请输入账号或工号" bindinput="inputUsername"/></view><view class="field"><text>密码</text><input value="{{password}}" password maxlength="128" placeholder="首次登录密码为本人工号" bindinput="inputPassword"/></view><button class="primary" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="bindAccount">绑定工号并登录</button><button loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="wechatLogin">重新验证微信</button></block><view class="login-tip">连续输错5次将锁定30分钟；忘记密码请联系系统管理员在 Web 后台重置。</view></view></block>
  <view wx:if="{{user && !user.passwordChangeRequired && subscriptionEligible}}" class="subscription-card">
    <view><strong>微信服务通知</strong><text class="subscription-state">{{subscriptionStatusText}}</text><text>首次开启时请选择“允许”，并勾选“总是保持以上选择，不再询问”；之后日常操作会自动补充通知次数。</text></view>
    <button wx:if="{{user.wechatBound && subscriptionEnabled}}" class="subscribe-button" bindtap="subscribeWechat">微信通知设置</button>
    <text wx:else class="subscription-hint">请先绑定当前微信后开启通知</text>
  </view>
</view>
